SUPERSEDED (crate-scoped, pre-convention)
Adjudicated 2026-09-16. fnd-cli predates the <!-- fb:creates|modifies PATH --> convention
and declares no target because its deliverable is a whole crate, not a file: "implement the
fb CLI surface". Its result was merged at the bootstrap commit (1772266) and has
since been superseded by every fb subcommand added since. There is no single file to freeze a
suite against, so it cannot be cross-examined by the current pipeline and its candidates
cannot be re-ranked. Marked finished so the board stops demanding critique of a task
completed before the machinery that would critique it existed.
The general gap is bead farmerbob-6mc: a crate-scoped deliverable has no declaration verb.
